# A directional menu: a D-pad direction picks that slot.
setup tests/scenarios/packs/menus.padpack Menus
press west
advance 100
tap dpad-right 30
advance 100
release west
---
overlay menu "Directional"                  @0
sound menu Open pop                         @0
sound menu Pick pop                         @100
overlay menu "Directional" selected "Right" @100
overlay none                                @100
sound menu Close pop                        @100
key KEY_R down                              @100
key KEY_R up                                @100
